{"id":"87c312b44f7ac774","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation-recursion.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Relation Recursion","display":"df-zfc-forcing-relation-recursion — ZFC Forcing Relation Recursion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-relation-recursion","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-relation-recursion"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-relation-recursion — ZFC Forcing Relation Recursion","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-relation-recursion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-relation-recursion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-relation-recursion — ZFC Forcing Relation Recursion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P\\in V\">\\(p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_*\">\\(M_*\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 中固定的地模型载集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o:V\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(o:V\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 中固定的偏函数。四参数调用相对于这同一对背景数据，不为每次调用重新存在选择模型或序。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P,R)\\)</span> 使用本书六参数定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelationRecursion}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelationRecursion}_S\\)</span> 保留四参数接口；六参数形式是下式给出的完全显式入口。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelationRecursion}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P,R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelationRecursion}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P,R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelationRecursion}_S(p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathbb P\\in\\operatorname{dom}(o)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M_*,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P,o(\\mathbb P)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelationRecursion}_S(p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathbb P\\in\\operatorname{dom}(o)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M_*,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P,o(\\mathbb P)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>旧接口的地模型与序依赖已在 Hypothesis 中明确；它不是对无关模型或无关序的存在性断言。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"911508dbd8495663","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"M_*","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"o:V\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelationRecursion}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelationRecursion}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P,R).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelationRecursion}_S(p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathbb P\\in\\operatorname{dom}(o)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M_*,p,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P,o(\\mathbb P)).","display":true}],"bytes":1407,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1984","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation-recursion.md|58-df-zfc-forcing-relation-recursion]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","911508dbd8495663"]}